=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: the test job's script moves into a template the job `extends:`
origin: issue #214 — a template a job extends is no site of its own: its commands are that job's.
=== before: .gitlab-ci.yml ===
stages:
  - lint
  - test

lint:
  stage: lint
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install ruff
    - ruff check .

test:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install -e .[test]
    - pytest
=== after: .gitlab-ci.yml ===
stages:
  - lint
  - test

lint:
  stage: lint
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install ruff
    - ruff check .

.tests:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install -e .[test]
    - pytest

test:
  extends: .tests
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "warn"}]
